# Agent workflows: definitions (.claudin/workflows/*.md) are shareable project
# config and should be committable; run state (.runs/) stays ignored. The
# nested re-include below only un-ignores workflow .md files — every other
# .claudin/* child (e.g. settings.json with plaintext keys) stays ignored.
!/.claudin/
/.claudin/*
!/.claudin/workflows/
/.claudin/workflows/*
!/.claudin/workflows/*.md
/.claudin/workflows/.runs/
coverage/
agent.log
dist-baseline/
dist-bench-baseline/
